[1.311, "o", "\r\n========================================================================\r\nACT 1 — The author fills out the intake questionnaire\r\n========================================================================\r\nREADME.md says: \"Requirements: R (tidyverse)\"\r\nYou are the author now — this is the real intake questionnaire,\r\nanswered live at the keyboard. Play along with the README and\r\nclaim the project is R-only.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36m[dr]\u001b[0m Does this project use data that is confidential, restricted, or covered by a data use agreement, IRB protocol, or NDA?\r\n  (I ask this first because I run on remote servers — restricted data must not be sent over the internet.)\r\n  Answer yes/no: "]
[10.986, "o", "n"]
